<h2>Green Bay claim questions</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>My Green Bay garage roof sagged under heavy snow. Is that a covered loss?</summary><div class="a"><p>Many policies cover collapse caused by the weight of snow or ice, though wording varies. If coverage is accepted but the amount is in dispute, appraisal can settle the cost of repair.</p></div></details><details><summary>How quickly should I act after an ice dam leak?</summary><div class="a"><p>Report the claim promptly, take photos, and dry the area to prevent further damage. Keep receipts for emergency work. Most policies require reasonable steps to protect the property.</p></div></details></div>
